<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" charset="UTF-8">
    <title>Alerte absence — RH</title>
    <style>
      @@media only screen and (max-width: 480px) {
        h3 { font-size: 12px !important; }
        p  { font-size: 12px !important; line-height: 1.4 !important; }
        div { padding: 10px !important; }
      }
    </style>
</head>
<body style="margin:0;padding:0;background-color:#F4F3FF;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;">

    <div style="background:#FDCB6E;padding:12px 16px;border-radius:8px 8px 0 0;">
        <h3 style="color:#ffffff;margin:0;font-size:14px;">⚠ Alerte Absence — RH</h3>
    </div>

    <div style="background:#ffffff;padding:16px;border-radius:0 0 8px 8px;">
        <p style="color:#555;font-size:13px;margin:0 0 12px 0;">
            Un employé est absent sans justificatif depuis plusieurs jours.
        </p>

        <div style="background:#F4F3FF;border-radius:6px;padding:12px;font-size:13px;color:#333;">
            <p style="margin:4px 0;"><strong>Employé :</strong> {{EmployeeFullName}}</p>
            <p style="margin:4px 0;"><strong>Email :</strong> {{EmployeeEmail}}</p>
            <p style="margin:4px 0;"><strong>Date :</strong> {{AbsenceDate}}</p>
            <p style="margin:4px 0;"><strong>Jours consécutifs :</strong> {{ConsecutiveDays}}</p>
        </div>

        <p style="color:#555;font-size:12px;margin:12px 0 0 0;">
            Veuillez contacter l'employé pour régulariser cette situation.
        </p>
    </div>

    <div style="text-align:center;padding:8px;font-size:11px;color:#888;">
        © 2026 Woridge. Tous droits réservés.
    </div>

</body>
</html>